Package: cnmarket
Type: Package
Title: A-Share Market Regime-Aware Market Data Toolkit
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("cnmarket", "Authors", email = "cnmarket@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight toolkit for A-share (Mainland China) market data built
    on the Tushare API. Unlike general-purpose market-data packages, it is aware
    of the A-share trading regime: it derives daily price limits from the board
    (Main Board 10 percent, STAR Market and ChiNext 20 percent, Beijing Stock
    Exchange 30 percent) and ST status (5 percent), tags limit-up, limit-down and
    trading-halt (suspension) days, computes the T+1 sellable date, and supports
    forward and backward price adjustment (qfq/hfq) from adjustment factors.
    Every request is cached on disk for offline reuse and rate-limit friendliness.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
